        <div class="miniGrid miniGrid--4">
          <div class="mini">
            <b>Throughput</b>
            <span>Placeholder — volume of candidates or work moving through the system over time.</span>
          </div>

          <div class="mini">
            <b>Pass-through rates</b>
            <span>Placeholder — percentage of candidates advancing from each stage to the next.</span>
          </div>

          <div class="mini">
            <b>Cycle time</b>
            <span>Placeholder — elapsed time between workflow events or stage transitions.</span>
          </div>

          <div class="mini">
            <b>Scheduling delays</b>
            <span>Placeholder — time lost to coordination failures, rescheduling, or missed SLAs.</span>
          </div>
