        <div class="miniGrid miniGrid--4">
          <div class="mini">
            <b>Bottlenecks</b>
            <span>Placeholder — stages where work accumulates faster than it moves forward.</span>
          </div>

          <div class="mini">
            <b>Capacity constraints</b>
            <span>Placeholder — limits on interviewer availability, coordinator bandwidth, or tool throughput.</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="callout">
          Operational signals reveal how the system is performing — not how people feel about it.
